 const help=document.createElement('dialog');help.id='public-guide';help.className='public-guide';
 help.innerHTML='<button type="button" class="inbox-close" aria-label="Close help">×</button><h2>Make your next application easier</h2><ol><li><strong>Upload your resume.</strong> Use a readable PDF, Word document or plain text. Check the extracted text and your years of experience.</li><li><strong>Choose your preferences.</strong> Select cities and a work style. Remote searches do not require a city.</li><li><strong>Explore jobs.</strong> When live search is available, results are ranked against your resume and preferences. You can also search LinkedIn, Naukri and Indeed with the links on the jobs screen. Always confirm the opening on the destination site.</li><li><strong>Set up application autofill.</strong> Install NextRole Application Autofill from Microsoft Edge Add-ons in Edge. Review your prefilled profile, add missing facts and save it with your resume to the extension. On an application page, scan, review and fill selected fields. Submit the application yourself.</li><li><strong>Prepare for a role.</strong> Open a job’s details to review its requirements and prepare your resume for that role.</li><li><strong>Track your applications.</strong> Add applications and referrals in Applications, update their status and download a private backup.</li></ol><h3>Your information</h3><p>Your resume, preferences and saved profile stay in this browser until replaced, removed or cleared with browser data. They do not automatically sync to another device. Review before filling: employer websites may save answers as you enter them.</p><p>Job matching runs on your device. Optional Gemini tailoring sends your resume, the selected job description and approved clarification answers to Google only after you connect your own key and agree. Missing qualifications are never added to your resume.</p><h3>What is available here?</h3><p>Resume upload, profile review, external job-site searches and the Edge autofill connection are available. Applications can be tracked on this device with backup and restore. Company jobs are refreshed through a public GitHub feed; availability must be checked at the company site. Optional semantic matching runs on your device after downloading its model. Gemini tailoring uses your own key, limited reviews and requests, with every content change requiring approval. Encrypted backups can be moved privately through your own cloud drive. Gmail sync remains disabled.</p><p>Matches and document checks do not guarantee an interview or an offer. Never pay a recruiter to apply.</p><p><a href="autofill-privacy.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read autofill privacy</a> · <a href="https://github.com/H-ana/NextRole/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get support</a></p><p>Support issues are public. Please do not include resumes, private messages, passwords or API keys.</p>';
 document.body.append(help);document.getElementById('public-help').onclick=()=>help.showModal();help.querySelector('.inbox-close').onclick=()=>help.close();
